{
  "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
  "body": "You have to take both `webp.txt` and `webp_io.py` from the ART-image io repo, put both in `$HOME/.config/ART/imageio`, and modify `webp_io.py` with the compression level you want. If you don't include `webp.txt` as well, your modified python script will never be called.\n\nHTH",
